{
 "about": "Events are attest (an agreeing attestation from a pair distinct from every earlier one), window_end, refetch_ok (the server fetched a copy within the simhash bound of a group) and refetch_fail. verified_by is whose text is indexed; frontier_row is the state of the pool entry's frontier row, null for a pushed entry. The expectations describe the end of the path on the assumption that moderation allows the page and indexing succeeds.",
